# TBCGuide - Hellfire Peninsula (58-62), Horde
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_Hellfire
@name Hellfire Peninsula (Thrallmar)
@faction Horde
@levels 58-62
@zone Hellfire Peninsula
@chapter Outland
@desc Through the Dark Portal to Thrallmar. Covers the Legion fronts, Reaver's Fall, Spinebreaker Post, Zeth'Gor, the Mag'har Grounds, Falcon Watch and the Cenarion Post. Hellfire Ramparts quests are optional.
@next H_Zangarmarsh

accept Through the Dark Portal [optional] | From the herald in Orgrimmar or Undercity (level 58).
turnin Through the Dark Portal [optional] | Lieutenant General Orion at the Stair of Destiny.
accept Arrival in Outland
turnin Arrival in Outland | Vlagga Freyfeather, wind rider master on the Stair.
accept Journey to Thrallmar
fly Thrallmar [unverified] | Journey to Thrallmar sends you on Vlagga Freyfeather's wind rider before you have the Thrallmar flight path.
fp Thrallmar
turnin Journey to Thrallmar | General Krakork.
accept Report to Nazgrel [optional]
turnin Report to Nazgrel [optional]
bind Thrallmar [area=3536]
accept Eradicate the Burning Legion | Nazgrel.
accept I Work... For the Horde! | Megzeg Nukklebust.
turnin Eradicate the Burning Legion | Sergeant Shatterskull, Reaver's Fall area.
accept Felspark Ravine
complete Felspark Ravine | Demons in Felspark Ravine.
turnin Felspark Ravine
accept Forward Base: Reaver's Fall
accept Wanted: Worg Master Kruush | Spinebreaker Post wanted poster.
complete Wanted: Worg Master Kruush | Zeth'Gor (east).
turnin Wanted: Worg Master Kruush
accept Zeth'Gor Must Burn!
accept Preparing the Salve | Grelag.
accept 10229 Decipher the Tome
accept The Warp Rifts | Ogath the Mad.
turnin Forward Base: Reaver's Fall | Forward Commander To'arch.
accept Disrupt Their Reinforcements
complete Disrupt Their Reinforcements | Click Portal Kruul and Portal Xilus.
turnin Disrupt Their Reinforcements
accept Mission: Gateways Murketh and Shaadraz
complete Mission: Gateways Murketh and Shaadraz | Use the wind rider at Reaver's Fall.
turnin Mission: Gateways Murketh and Shaadraz
accept Mission: The Abyssal Shelf | Group quest: Fel Cannon and Gan'arg Peon are elite.
accept Return to Thrallmar
complete Mission: The Abyssal Shelf | Elite: Fel Cannon and Gan'arg Peon; bring help or skip.
turnin Mission: The Abyssal Shelf
fp Spinebreaker Ridge
turnin Return to Thrallmar
accept Forge Camp: Mageddon
accept Bonechewer Blood | Vurtok Axebreaker.
complete Bonechewer Blood | Bonechewer orcs along the road.
complete I Work... For the Horde! | Collect the debris near Thrallmar.
complete Preparing the Salve | Hellfire Spineleaf: loot Hellfire Spineleaf.
complete The Warp Rifts | Void Ridge warp rifts.
turnin Bonechewer Blood
accept Apothecary Zelana
turnin Apothecary Zelana | Spinebreaker Post, south.
accept Spinebreaker Post
turnin Preparing the Salve
accept Investigate the Crash
turnin Spinebreaker Post
accept Boiling Blood
complete Boiling Blood
turnin Boiling Blood
accept Apothecary Antonivich
accept The Eyes of Grillok | Zezzak.
turnin 10229 Decipher the Tome
