turnin I Work... For the Horde!
accept Burn It Up... For the Horde!
complete Burn It Up... For the Horde!
complete Investigate the Crash
complete Void Ridge | Void Ridge Soul Shard drops from Collapsing Voidwalker and Vacillating Voidcaller.
accept 10393 Vile Plans
complete Forge Camp: Mageddon | Head of Forgefiend Razorsaw drops from Razorsaw.
turnin Burn It Up... For the Horde!
turnin Apothecary Antonivich
accept A Burden of Souls | Group quest: Drillmaster Zurok is elite.
complete A Burden of Souls | Elite: Drillmaster Zurok; bring help or skip.
