accept A Strange Weapon | Needs level 60. If you are lower, {name} skips it and moves on.
turnin A Strange Weapon
accept The Warchief's Mandate | Needs level 60. If you are lower, {name} skips it and moves on.
turnin The Warchief's Mandate | Far Seer Regulkut at the Mag'har Post (north-west).
