grind 62 Quillfang Ravager, Quillfang Skitterer [at=23.7,66.6] | The next steps expect level 62 and the quests here don't quite get you there: grind these until you reach it.
note Ride west from Falcon Watch into Zangarmarsh; Zabra'jin is the Horde town on the western side.
